WEBVTT

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:44.870
It's summer.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:47.030
It's the ocean!

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:57.310
We're on our way to the Mizuhosaka Academy's boarding house.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.860
It all started when...

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:01.620
A trip?

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.830
I was thinking that, since it's summer break,

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:07.250
we should go to the mountains or the beach or something.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.720
There really aren't any good places.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:17.990
Is there room at an inn with big rooms, which are really cheap and really nice,

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:21.770
and that's near the sea and mountains and has really good food?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:25.060
I don't think there's any place that convenient...

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.070
There is.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:27.590
Takamine-senpai!

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:29.620
Where is this this place then?

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.590
Our school's boarding house.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:36.390
But they don't let you use that unless you're on a club trip...

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.060
Don't worry!

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:43.000
We can go there if we say it's part of the Fortune Telling Research Club's trip.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.740
Actually I figured this might happen...

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:53.010
...so I left your names on the Fortune Telling Research Club's member list.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.320
That was clever.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:02.640
Shikimori-san and the Kamijou siblings became temporary members,

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:06.580
and Otoha-san is coming with us as a temporary adviser.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:10.580
I hope we have a fun trip!

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:24.400
<b>Summer Expectations</b>

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:29.850
This is our school's boarding house?

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.750
Yes, it's like a rental cabin.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.340
It looks pretty good!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:39.090
Where did everybody go?!

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:41.210
Mom, over here!

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:44.640
There you are!

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.740
Don't leave me alone!

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.590
Who's leading who here?

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:53.740
Shinya's up to his usual tricks again?

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.650
I'm sorry.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:58.740
We'll have to use our secret method.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.650
Oh, it's Takamizo-dono.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.040
I think I wet myself.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.560
What a pretty view of the ocean!

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.820
We're right on the beach!

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.480
That's Mizuhosaka Academy's private beach,

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.650
so you won't be bothered by anybody else when you're swimming.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:28.790
Great!

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:29.930
Let's swim, Haruhi!

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:30.560
OK!

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.710
OK, let's swim!

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.730
Hey!  At least pick up your clothes.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:38.440
There's no use trying to talk to to Hachi right now.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.860
Wh-What?

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:45.020
Yuuma, there's something I want you to do for me during this trip.

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.960
Something you want me to do?

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:48.930
Be nice to Haruhi-chan!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.420
W-What are you talking about?

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:54.380
I don't think I treat her any different...

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:55.710
Liar!

00:04:55.710 --> 00:05:00.290
There's always a harsh edge to your voice when you talk to Haruhi-chan.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.720
I don't really think I...

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:07.880
I know you don't really like magic.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:13.040
But that's not Haruhi-chan's fault.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:19.170
But, you know, just using magic doesn't guarantee you'll be happy.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:30.100
This is what happens when you try to attract customers with magic!

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:34.710
Haruhi-chan's a good girl.
She wants to be friends with you.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.690
Be nice to her.

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.720
I'll try.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:41.910
You're not going to try; you're going to do it!

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:44.930
Failure to become friends with her will result in considerable pain.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.880
I-I get it!  I get it!

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:51.960
Take that!

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.220
It's cold!

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.130
That bikini looks great on you, Hime-chan!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.620
Thanks!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.310
And your bikini is really sexy, Anri-chan!

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.560
It's very grown up, isn't it?

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:16.320
I wish I had breasts like those two...

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:18.420
It's OK, Sumomo-chan.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:21.150
Once you grow up you will.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.780
Your mom guarantees it!

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.100
I don't think I can trust your guarantees in that outfit...

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:29.130
I actually think it makes me even more uneasy.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.650
Why a school swimsuit anyway?

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.500
It fits her so well it's scary.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.030
<i>You're all here early!</i>

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.440
Tama-chan, those look great on you!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.200
<i>Thanks!</i>

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:41.950
Wow!  A black bikini!

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.920
Very grown up!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.160
But why do you have a mage's hat on?

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.160
The sun is strong in summer...

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.720
That's right!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.260
Expose your skin in a place like this and you'll be crispy black in a minute!

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.910
Put on sunblock before you go swimming!

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.200
As she says.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.370
<i>How is it, miss?</i>

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.480
It feels good, Tama-chan.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.920
OK, I'll go first.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.160
Haruhi-chan, help me out.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.960
OK, I'll get started.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:30.090
Haruhi-chan, Yuuma says he'll put it on you.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.010
I-Is that all right?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:36.010
Yeah, but Anri-chan...

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:41.580
I'm fine, get to it before Yuuma changes his mind.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.970
Thanks.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:47.240
Then, I'll take care of Anri-chan!

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:48.160
To the moon!

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.900
Lovely summer experiences...

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.120
L-Like this?

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:08.930
Uhm, try pressing it out more with your whole hand...

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.520
L-Like this?

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:19.540
U-Uhm, if it's getting in the way,
you can untie my bikini top...

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:21.970
Y-Yeah...

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:26.620
You're all grown up...in a lot of ways...

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.920
Ibuki-chan's taking a while.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.100
Ibuki-sama!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.370
Wild dogs!

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:49.220
Both of you get back!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:51.000
But, Ibuki-sama...

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.000
It's fine!

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.620
This is...

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.710
There was a barrier up?

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:07.420
No uninvited guests, I guess.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:10.220
<i>However, it's not that strong.</i>

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.690
That's right.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:16.630
Take that!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.000
OK!

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:19.700
All right!

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:30.710
Aaah!  I'm glad to be alive!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.090
Ibuki-chan!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:42.950
I won't lose!

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:57.690
Good luck!

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.620
Smash it into bits!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.500
No!  Not there!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.100
<i>M-Miss, no!</i>

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.100
What should I do?

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.650
Every summer trip must have a test of courage.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:21.540
Doesn't somebody usually play the role of the ghost and scare everybody during these?

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:25.590
Come to think of it, everybody's here.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.220
Don't worry about that.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:36.860
Since this is the Fortune Telling Research Club's trip, the ghost members of the club are going to be the ghosts.

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:40.790
Hello, everyone...

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:44.220
They're real ghosts?!

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:11.860
Just a bit more, Hachi!

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:12.670
Jeez...

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.640
First!

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:18.070
Too bad!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.030
<i>We're the first ones here.</i>

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.950
We just got here a few minutes ago.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:29.510
So it's Anri-chan and Koyuki-san who don't have to take a turn at cooking...

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:32.730
You didn't use magic, did you?

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.420
Of course not!

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.150
What nice scenery...

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:40.690
Really, it feels great to look at.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.660
This was a great choice for a hike.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:49.750
And having us pair up and having the first here getting to not have to cook were a great ideas, too.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.180
But I'm a bit surprised.

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:57.050
I was sure Haruhi would be the first one here after us.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:13:03.000
It'll be a while before Haruhi-chan and Yuuma get here.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.010
The map I gave them is a fake!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:06.010
WRITING:  Peak

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:10.720
This is the peak...in theory.

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:15.090
Not a chance.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.780
But it's a really nice waterfall.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.010
Yeah.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:21.250
Want to swim a bit?

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.720
We'll never be first now.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.450
Let's rest.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.620
But we don't have our-!  Kamisaka-san!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.710
I figured we'd get sweaty,

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.430
so I wore my swimsuit underneath.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.370
I see...

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:49.490
Putting Shinya-kun and Saya-chan aside,
Sumomo-chan and Ibuki-chan sure are late.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.240
Did they get lost?

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.690
Ibuki-chan?

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:59.100
Where did you go?

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.300
It feels good...

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:13.960
Kamisaka-san?

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.170
What?

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:18.310
Your family lives very far away, don't they?

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.580
You live in a dorm after all.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:24.170
You're right.  It's a bit far to commute every day.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:27.730
But I used to live near you.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.970
I played with Sumomo-chan all the time back then.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:35.170
You said that a boy once saved you with magic.

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:38.160
That wasn't back then, was it?

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.090
Yeah, it was...

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:42.300
Why?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.490
It's nothin-

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:44.530
Kamisaka-san!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.030
Soprano...

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.060
<i>Yes, Haruhi!</i>

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.390
Idiot!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:02.450
You could've dodged that without using magic!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:04.330
Why do you always try to rely on magic before you do anything else?!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:07.660
If you did and it didn't work...

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.290
I'm sorry.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:13.450
Let's go.  Everybody's waiting.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:14.720
Yeah.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.940
There they are.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.340
They seem kind of unhappy.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:38.380
Maybe the fake map wasn't a good idea.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.980
Ibuki-chan, just a bit more.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:44.540
I know, you don't need to pull me so hard!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.920
Yeah, but I don't want you to get lost again!

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:52.960
Sumomo-chan and Ibuki-san are here, too.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:54.300
All that's left are...

00:15:56.580 --> 00:16:00.190
Brother, this doesn't look like the summit of a mountain.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:03.140
Wh-Why?!

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:10.100
Fireworks!

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:12.220
Fireworks!

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:15.660
<i>We can't lose to this.</i>

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:16.840
<i>Miss, go!</i>

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:17.450
OK!

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.400
<i>Yes, here I go!</i>

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.770
Tama-chan, go!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:29.770
<i>Tama-chan fireworks!</i>

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.920
Everybody, watch out for the fire.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.250
Right!

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:56.610
Sorry, Yuuma.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:17:01.880
I gave you that fake map so that you'd end up spending more time together...

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.860
I guess it didn't work.

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:07.290
No, it's not the map's fault.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:10.490
Yuuma...

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:14.530
I'm counting on you.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.700
<i>Understood, Ibuki-sama.</i>

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:25.750
<i>Er Amsti Ral Seires!</i>

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:29.520
<i>Di Latel Lamresties!</i>

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.220
<i>You don't seem to be concentrating properly, Haruhi.</i>

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:51.830
You're practicing magic even here?

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.660
Kohinata-kun...

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:27.810
Ibuki-sama, where is Bisaim?

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:30.610
There's something I want to see.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:32.340
Want to see?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:35.840
She might be their daughter.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.450
No way!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:42.890
If she is, there is much I must consider.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:45.560
It's become a daily habit.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.840
Practicing before bed.

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:50.460
I want to be as good as I can.

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:51.780
Why do you go so far?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:58.370
Part of me thinks that if I become a talented mage, I may be able to meet that boy.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:02.190
But I want to make people happy with magic.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:04.140
People all over the world.

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:07.700
But there are a lot of people who don't like magic.

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:08.910
Well...

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:10.270
I understand.

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:12.330
I'll be careful from here on.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.560
I see.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.190
All right, I'm heading back.

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:15.920
OK.

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:27.130
Soprano!

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:32.520
Why do you always try to rely on magic before you do anything else?

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.360
<i>Haruhi!</i>

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.080
Soprano!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:37.520
Why?

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.420
Why doesn't she use her magic?

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:40.840
What happened?!

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:43.230
Kohinata-kun, run!

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:52.060
I don't care if he hates me, I want to save him!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:57.430
<i>El Amniary Lefs Kartia Amslai!</i>

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:18.530
I'm sorry.  I used magic again.

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:22.690
I knew you didn't like it.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:25.610
Kamisaka-san, thank you.

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:30.000
I just don't like it used in the wrong way.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.960
I don't dislike magic.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:36.880
So really...you, too...

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:39.890
Uhm...

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:43.010
Can I call you by your first name from now on, Kamisaka-san?

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.940
Haruhi?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:49.730
I really wanted to be friends with you.

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:51.900
Got it, Yuuma-kun.

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:56.830
It's not fair for only you to call me by my first name.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.760
That's right!

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.170
Look!

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:06.920
Look at all the stars...

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:17.770
<i>Ibuki-sama, her bright name is Kartia.</i>

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.680
Then it's as I thought!

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:24.130
<i>I believe the probability of your suspicions being correct exceeds 90%.</i>

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:28.700
Kamisaka Haruhi is that woman's daughter?

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.620
OK, which is it, Yuuma-kun?

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:45.530
From the pattern Haruhi's used up till now...

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.000
It's this one!

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:50.640
All right, I'll draw a card.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.610
She tricked me again!

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:56.370
Aren't you two a lot friendlier?

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.310
Good, good!

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.860
Let's stop playing Old Maid already.

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:02.930
No way, we're just getting started.

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:04.050
That's right.

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:08.730
Thanks to the trip I was able to get closer to Yuuma-kun.

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:11.480
But I didn't realize...

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:19.390
...that a dark shadow was drawing ever closer to me.

00:23:55.010 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.900 --> 00:23:58.740
Do a good deed every day!  This is Kamisaka Haruhi!

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:01.810
Our next episode is the school festival!

00:24:01.810 --> 00:24:03.630
Those are great, aren't they?

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.280
Easy to comment on...

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:07.720
I'm sure there'll be cafés and English plays,

00:24:07.720 --> 00:24:09.910
and everybody will have a lot of fun!

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:11.850
They won't?

00:24:11.850 --> 00:24:15.050
Instead incredible secrets will be revealed,

00:24:15.050 --> 00:24:16.690
and incredible things happen!

00:24:16.690 --> 00:24:19.090
And then Haruhi in particular...

00:24:19.090 --> 00:24:24.970
Do we have to do all this during the school festival episode?

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>School Festival</b>
